&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stagnating kingdom of Punea is succeeded by emperor Tokina. New emperor has many wives who gave birth to six sons. Main character is the sixth son Leon. He&amp;rsquo;s the last in the line of succession, so needs to execute enormous efforts to ever wear the crown.&lt;/p&gt;
